    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d149">

                <pb facs="0288" n="176" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg176"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conference 861.00/292b:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to the Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-02-26T21:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 26,
                                1919, 9 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>41. For Bullitt. Please bear in mind that
                    the unjust imprisonment of Kalamatiano in Moscow and the detention of
                        Tredwell in Tashkent cause deep concern and serve as
                    constant source of irritation to American Government. Choose the best
                    opportunity to convey to the representatives of the Moscow Government that this
                    is a matter which will not be dropped or forgotten.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>]
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
